{"id":"431229","name":"番茄蘑菇浓汤","author":"柳絮1982","authorId":"563830","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/431229/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"番茄","amount":"一个"},{"name":"金针菇","amount":"适量"},{"name":"白玉菇","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"番茄沙司","amount":"适量"},{"name":"糖","amount":"适量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蚝油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱花","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好的材料。","img":"images/431229/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"蘑菇洗净，切段，西红柿切块。","img":"images/431229/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"西红柿放到料理机里打碎。","img":"images/431229/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"蘑菇焯水。","img":"images/431229/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"处理好的食材。","img":"images/431229/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"锅中加底油。","img":"images/431229/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入放茄汁和番茄沙司。","img":"images/431229/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"将番茄汤煮开。","img":"images/431229/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入蘑菇。","img":"images/431229/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"煮开，放入蘑菇。","img":"images/431229/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"撒入葱沫。","img":"images/431229/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品，如果想汤汁浓稠可以多煮一会。","img":"images/431229/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}